      "source_document": "569555",
      "original_line": 212,
      "text": "(c), sub-cl. (i), of the proviso to sub-s. (1) of s. 13 of the Control Act of 1952. The learned Subordinate judge gave his judgment on June 11, 1957. It has to be noted that these judgments were given prior to the coming into force of the Control Act of 1958. cite12†That Act came into force on February 9, 1959. On August 26, 1957 the respondent- landlord moved the High Court of Punjab in revision under s. 35 of the Control Act of 1952.",
